1200 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: I knew it was a set-up! The King of the North lured us here, to the\stone circle!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1210 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: It's getting dark. There's no houses nearby, and we're too far away\to walk the way back... Damn that Connors! He was in on it!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1220 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: We can't stay here. We have to go back to the hotel, even if we\have to walk. We might cross a car along the way.":GOSUB 5100
1230 W2=0:GOSUB 6110:GOSUB 6310:BM$="Just as they started walking, they noticed a car approaching them with\the headlights turned off.":GOSUB 5100
1240 BM$="Susanna: There's no way that's a tourist coming to see Stonehenge this\late. It has to be northern assassins! David, what should we do?!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1250 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: We'll never get away by running. Let's hide among the megaliths!":GOSUB 5100
1260 COMMON FO:GOSUB 9545:GOSUB 6145:BM$="David and Susanna entered the stone circle.":GOSUB 5100
1265 GOSUB 9010:'
1270 GOSUB 6120:BM$="They hid in the shadows of the megaliths. The car stopped at the end of\the paved road, and four individuals wearing white robes got out.":GOSUB 5100
1280 ISET X:GOSUB 9050:BM$="The four white shadows approached the megaliths. David and Susanna\watched them, holding their breath.":GOSUB 5100
1290 GOSUB 6130:BM$="One of the shadows shouted towards the stone circle.":GOSUB 5100
1300 BM$="Shadow: David! The northern tribes have concluded that you have\inherited the blood of the Devil King! You may not believe it, but we\northern sorcerers can sense the dark waves that flow in your veins!":GOSUB 5100
1310 BM$="Shadow: Ask Susanna, the dark sorceress, and she will confirm our words.\Of course, you have no time for that right now... You can ask her in hell!":GOSUB 5100
1320 BM$="Shadow: Susanna! We have dealt with the dark sorcerers you contacted\before you even reached Bristol! The King of the North shall be here soon\to witness your death with his very eyes.":GOSUB 5100:BM$="You may consider these the last moments of your life!":GOSUB 5100
1330 W1=0:POLL X:GOSUB 6140:GOSUB 6300:BM$="There was only one shadow in front of them. When David turned his head,\he noticed that the other three had taken place at his left, right, and\back.":GOSUB 5100
