1600 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: A magical tetragon... David, we're trapped in the stone circle! The\northern spell will prevent us from leaving!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1610 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: So it's true? You're a sorceress? Why didn't you tell me?!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1620 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Just like you've inherited the blood of the Devil King, I've\inherited the blood of Susanna, who served King Hroth. The two of us are\their descendants...":GOSUB 5100
1630 BM$="Susanna: You've never fallen in love with any woman other than me, have\you? I've been in love with you since I was a child. You were always in my\dreams. Susanna: Before she passed away, my mother taught me the power":GOSUB 5100:BM$="of magic, and told me about the blood of the Devil King.":GOSUB 5100
1640 BM$="Susanna: That's why I've been trying to protect you from the King of the\North. But I guess you just can't fight fate...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1650 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: So those pills you gave me for my nightmares...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1660 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: They were made by dark sorcerers, yes. There are many who've\inherited the blood of the original dark sorcerers, but only few can be\said to be truly powerful.":GOSUB 5100
1670 BM$="Susanna: We sorcerers can't hope to defeat the King of the North... but it\would be easy for you, if you were to awaken the power of your blood!":GOSUB 5100
1680 COMMON FO:GOSUB 9020:GOSUB 9515:GOSUB 6150:BM$="At that moment, they heard the sound of a car engine in the distance.\Then, they noticed its headlights approaching.":GOSUB 5100:'
1690 GOSUB 6135:BM$="After looking towards the car, the white shadow in front of David shouted\at him.":GOSUB 5100
1700 BM$="Shadow: The King of the North will cast a curse upon you. Though I have\never witnessed it myself, it is said that the agony is unimaginable. This\should be entertaining.":GOSUB 5100
1710 GOSUB 6160:BM$="The car approached the stone circle, stopping next to the car used by\the northern sorcerers.":GOSUB 5100
1720 BM$="For a while, nobody came out, as if waiting for something to happen.":GOSUB 5100
1730 GOSUB 6170:BM$="Eventually, the passenger door opened, and a man came out. The white\shadow who was approaching the car stopped in his tracks...":GOSUB 5100
1740 BM$="Northern sorcerer: You're not the King of the North. Are you a dark\sorcerer...?":GOSUB 5100
1750 BM$="The man put a hand in his suit and pulled out a gun, aiming it at the\northern sorcerer.":GOSUB 5100
1760 BM$="Susanna stared at the man, whose face was clearly illuminated by the\car's headlights.":GOSUB 5100
1770 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: That's Clark, one of the detectives employed by the northern\tribesmen. The driver is his assistant, Vince. Do the northern sorcerers\not recognize him...?":GOSUB 5100
1780 BM$="Susanna: This is our chance, David. The northern sorcerers are\distracted, and the tetragon is broken. Let's get into their car!":GOSUB 5100
1790 GOSUB 9090:GOSUB 6180:BM$="Susanna pushed David, urging him to run. The white shadows at their sides\chased after them.":GOSUB 5100
1800 GOSUB 6190:BM$="Noticing this, Clark pointed his gun at the robed men, and pulled the\trigger.":GOSUB 5100
1810 BM$="The four shadows stopped. Clark kept aiming his gun at them.":GOSUB 5100
1820 GOSUB 9516:GOSUB 6280:BM$="The lights of yet another car were approaching the site.":GOSUB 5100
1830 GOSUB 6160:BM$="Vince opened the rear door to let David and Susanna in.":GOSUB 5100
1840 GOSUB 9555:GOSUB 5510:GOSUB 9505:GOSUB 5510:GOSUB 9516:BM$="Clark fired his gun into the tires of the sorcerers' car, then jumped into\his own car. Vince floored the pedal, and they left at a dangerously high\speed.":GOSUB 5100
1845 GOSUB 6200:POLL X
1850 BM$="Almost colliding with the incoming car, they were able to get away from\the megaliths of Stonehenge.":GOSUB 5100
